Hi Karl,

Sorry, what I mean is that the founders were funneled so that we ended up with [{(AxB)x(CxD)}x{(ExF)x(GxH)}] But then we carried out an additional cross so that the final lines carried forward to selfing had the crossing scheme: ([{(AxB)x(CxD)}x{(ExF)x(GxH)}]x [{(DxG)x(CxB)}x{(HxE)x(FxA)}]) for example.

Does your answer still stand?

Thanks,,
Conor

