With the genril cross type, you want to choose the number of generations to get the frequency of recombinations to match the actual crossing scheme. See the top of the right column of page 3 in https://doi.org/10.1093/g3journal/jkab396

If you want a cross type that matches the actual cross design that you had used, we'd need to do quite a bit more work to create a new cross type.

karl

karl

